<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Jones cut to underperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Jones cut to underperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said analyst Ed Atorino downgraded Dow Jones &amp; Co Inc to underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Shares shed 1-1/4 to 35-1/2.</p>
</text>
